        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if your soul refused to move on?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>One Last Journey</i>, you play as <strong>Selene</strong> and <strong>Aurel</strong>, two souls caught between life and the afterlife. Explore a hauntingly beautiful world of forgotten cities, broken memories, and ghostlight ruins as you uncover the bond that once bound you—and the silence that tore it apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/ddda1bbf634d4ad106b7c073c2a0bbd2.poster.avif?t=1767401864\" width=808 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/ddda1bbf634d4ad106b7c073c2a0bbd2.webm?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/ddda1bbf634d4ad106b7c073c2a0bbd2.mp4?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dual Narrative:</strong> Switch between Selene and Aurel, as their paths echo through time — one in the present, one lost in the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric World:</strong> Explore handcrafted pixel environments from the corrupted sewers to the soul-lit city of Echohold and the darkness below.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Storytelling:</strong> Uncover a tale of love, regret, and remembrance told through dialogue, found memories, and environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey to the End:</strong> There are no branching paths, no choices to undo. This is one last journey — and it only ends one way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/d08302dcb5cba858fbd8bc93f4dd1093.poster.avif?t=1767401864\" width=808 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/d08302dcb5cba858fbd8bc93f4dd1093.webm?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/d08302dcb5cba858fbd8bc93f4dd1093.mp4?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat &amp; Movement:</strong> Use spirit abilities like dashing  or wielding spectral sword in combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/fbc15505c8a723e17ca4b1141939ec5b.poster.avif?t=1767401864\" width=922 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/fbc15505c8a723e17ca4b1141939ec5b.webm?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/fbc15505c8a723e17ca4b1141939ec5b.mp4?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if your soul refused to move on?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>One Last Journey</i>, you play as <strong>Selene</strong> and <strong>Aurel</strong>, two souls caught between life and the afterlife. Explore a hauntingly beautiful world of forgotten cities, broken memories, and ghostlight ruins as you uncover the bond that once bound you—and the silence that tore it apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/ddda1bbf634d4ad106b7c073c2a0bbd2.poster.avif?t=1767401864\" width=808 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/ddda1bbf634d4ad106b7c073c2a0bbd2.webm?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/ddda1bbf634d4ad106b7c073c2a0bbd2.mp4?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dual Narrative:</strong> Switch between Selene and Aurel, as their paths echo through time — one in the present, one lost in the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric World:</strong> Explore handcrafted pixel environments from the corrupted sewers to the soul-lit city of Echohold and the darkness below.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Storytelling:</strong> Uncover a tale of love, regret, and remembrance told through dialogue, found memories, and environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey to the End:</strong> There are no branching paths, no choices to undo. This is one last journey — and it only ends one way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/d08302dcb5cba858fbd8bc93f4dd1093.poster.avif?t=1767401864\" width=808 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/d08302dcb5cba858fbd8bc93f4dd1093.webm?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/d08302dcb5cba858fbd8bc93f4dd1093.mp4?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat &amp; Movement:</strong> Use spirit abilities like dashing  or wielding spectral sword in combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/fbc15505c8a723e17ca4b1141939ec5b.poster.avif?t=1767401864\" width=922 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/fbc15505c8a723e17ca4b1141939ec5b.webm?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/fbc15505c8a723e17ca4b1141939ec5b.mp4?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
